[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/738164212","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1111#issuecomment-738164212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1111","id":738164212,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDczODE2NDIxMg==","user":{"login":"johnmhoran","id":11096678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2Njc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran","html_url":"https://github.com/johnmhoran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-12-03T17:31:05Z","updated_at":"2020-12-03T17:31:05Z","body":"@swinslow I'll tackle this submission.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/738164212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/754167721","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1111#issuecomment-754167721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1111","id":754167721,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1NDE2NzcyMQ==","user":{"login":"johnmhoran","id":11096678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2Njc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran","html_url":"https://github.com/johnmhoran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-04T19:25:22Z","updated_at":"2021-01-04T19:25:22Z","body":"TL;DR: Given the stature of The FreeBSD Project and the popularity of its BSD distributions, I think this license should be added.\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\nIt does not appear that the submitter (https://github.com/shujisado) has any direct connection to the asserted author/steward (The FreeBSD Project: https://www.freebsd.org/). \r\n\r\nThe proposed license appears to be based on \"The FreeBSD Copyright\" (https://www.freebsd.org/copyright/freebsd-license.html), with changes made to refer to documentation rather than source code, as well as the addition of a section titled \"Manual Pages\" that refers to \"pages [that] contain text from the IEEE Std 1003.1, 2004 Edition, Standard for Information Technology -- Portable Operating System Interface (POSIX®) specification.\"\r\n\r\nNote that \"The FreeBSD Copyright\" license is included on the SPDX license list as \"BSD 2-Clause FreeBSD License\" (short identifier: \"BSD-2-Clause-FreeBSD\") and has been deprecated.  See https://spdx.org/licenses/BSD-2-Clause-FreeBSD.html. \r\n\r\nThird-party references to the proposed license include:\r\n\r\nMicrosoft Teams Third Party Notice for iOS\r\nhttps://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/microsoft-teams-third-party-notice-for-ios-2cb2ca96-40d1-4282-aabe-5c5c4bcf35c7 \r\n- Includes license text (\"Copyright 1994-2016 The FreeBSD Project.\").\r\n- Most recent date for copyright notices on that page (other than the Microsoft notice at the bottom, which is 2021) is 2017.\r\n\r\nCisco NAC Profiler Installation and Configuration Guide, Release 3.1\r\nhttps://content.cisco.com/chapter.sjs?uri=/searchable/chapter/www.cisco.com/content/en/us/td/docs/security/nac/profiler/configuration_guide/310/nac_profiler_book/p_apx_open31.html.xml \r\n- Includes license text (\"Copyright 1994-2009 The FreeBSD Project.\").\r\n- \"Published On: August 5ᵗʰ, 2019 19:05\"\r\n\r\ngnu.org -- listed under \"Licenses For Documentation\" as \"FreeBSD Documentation License\"\r\nhttps://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.en.html#FreeBSDDL \r\n- Described as \"a permissive non-copyleft free documentation license that is compatible with the GNU FDL\", though note that the link leads to a page containing the text of the source code license, not the documentation license (https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/License:BSD-2-Clause-FreeBSD). \r\n\r\nSome third parties have adapted the text of the proposed license for their own purposes.  See, e.g.,\r\n\r\nInstalling and Using Common Lisp Libraries\r\nhttp://rpgoldman.real-time.com/lisp/fight-the-system.html \r\n\r\n- includes similar but not identical version of the 1st of the 2 parts of the submitted license\r\n\r\nOcempGUI Manual\r\nhttp://ocemp.sourceforge.net/manual/ocempgui-manual.html \r\n\r\n- includes similar but not identical version of the 1st of the 2 parts of the submitted license\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/lic